{
	"Site": "Nexus",
	"Id": 11596,
	"Name": "Cookie Clicker Suite",
	"Author": "OmegaFallon",
	"AuthorLabel": "Omega Fallon",
	"Description": "Finally, all the weirdness, humor, and political commentary of Cookie Clicker arrives in Stardew Valley! Not that anyone was really asking for it, but I went and did it anyway, because that's what science is about... or something.\n<br />\n<br />The core of this mod is the crops, based off of the ones you can grow in the garden in Cookie Clicker. You'll gain access to the new crops at the start of year 2, announced by a letter from everyone's favorite granny, Evelyn. To begin with, you'll only be able to get Baker's Wheat and Meddleweed; you'll have to crossbreed the rest yourself! This mod tries to be as true to Cookie Clicker as possible, due to my great adoration for the game, so all the crossbreeding recipes from that game carry over into this mod.\n<br />\n<br />But that's not all! In addition to the crops, this mod also adds:[list]\n<br />[*]Many new recipes!\n<br />[*]All milk upgrades!\n<br />[*]Wrinklers as catchable fish!\n<br />[*]Reindeer, easter bunnies, and cookie dragons as purchasable animals!\n<br />[*]New ores and other mineral-adjacent items based off of the upgrade tiers!\n<br />[*]Decorative versions of all the buildings + some other CC stuff!\n<br />[*]Wallpapers based off of the ones in Cookie Clicker!\n<br />[*]Pantheon gods added as idol artifacts!\n<br />[*]Seasonal changes, mostly cosmetic but with some opportunities for unique foraging!\n<br />[*]Sugar lumps as artisan goods!\n<br />[*]Horrifying implications about Evelyn's true nature!\n<br />[*]A bunch of other random junk from Cookie Clicker!\n<br />[/list]\n<br />Planned features:\n<br />[list]\n<br />[*]Lots more recipes, enough that every crop is used in at least one of them\n<br />[*]More stuff with Evelyn\n<br />[*]Additional items and other stuff from the Cookie Clicker universe! Suggestions welcome!\n<br />[/list]",
